OL,3,GNEWSAEvening qualifying sessions
OL,4,Acancelled due to rain
OL,5,
OL,6,FA planned evening qualifying session
OL,7,Ffor the Manx Grand Prix and Classic TT
OL,8,Fhas been cancelled due to forecasted
OL,9,Fheavy showers.
OL,11,FOrganisers said roads around the 37.7
OL,12,Fmile (61km) Mountain Course, which had
OL,13,Fbeen due to close from 18:00 BST on
OL,14,FWednesday, would now remain open.
OL,16,FThe decision followed the use of a
OL,17,Fcontingency road-closure period on
OL,18,FWednesday afternoon after disruption to
OL,19,Fthe opening sessions due to poor
OL,20,Fweather and red flag incidents.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
