OL,3,GNEWSAEvening qualifying sessions
OL,4,Acancelled due to rain
OL,5,
OL,6,FClerk of the course Gary Thompson
OL,7,Fconfirmed a similar extra session `
OL,8,Fbetween 12:30 and 17:00 on Thursday `
OL,9,Fwould be used as a result.
